  "text": "Veterinarian in Idaho Falls, ID | Countryside Veterinary Hospital\nPatient Portal\n3120 S Woodruff Ave, Idaho Falls, ID 83404\n208-522-8010\nAbout\nMeet Our Doctors\nDr. Nathan Rolston\nDr. Kathy Shoemaker\nDr. Susie Mackin\nDr. Brad Francis\nJob Opportunities\nCareers\nContact\nReviews\nBlog\nServices\nPreventative Care\nWellness Exams\nDental Care\nMicrochipping\nDiagnostics\nSoft Tissue Surgery\nLaser Surgery\nOrthopedic Surgery\nCancer Treatment\nTherapeutic Laser Treatment\nEmergency Care\nBoarding\nResources\nCommonly Asked About Conditions\nNew Client Information\nNew Client Form\nPayment Plans\nPermission of Care Form\nSurgery Information\nFAQs\nOnline Pharmacy\nPatient Portal\n208-522-8010\n30 Years of Healing Paws in Idaho Falls and Counting\nPremier Vet Care in Idaho Falls, ID\nWelcome to Countryside Veterinary Hospital\nThe caring and compassionate staff at Countryside Veterinary Hospital has been providing health care for companion animals for over 30 years. Our state-of-the-art facility, convenient location, and wide selection of services make Countryside Veterinary Hospital the preferred provider of veterinary care in Eastern Idaho.\nLEARN MORE\nComprehensive Veterinary Services Near You\nCompassionate, comprehensive veterinary care to keep your pet healthy through every stage of life. From wellness visits to advanced treatment, we’re here when your pet needs us most.\nVIEW ALL SERVICES\nPreventative Care\nLearn more\nSoft Tissue Surgery\nLearn more\nWellness Exams\nLearn more\nFirst Step\nWe’re Excited to Meet\nNew Clients\nNew Client Information\nWhether you're new to the area or looking for a new veterinary home, we're glad you're here. Our experienced team provides attentive care for every stage of your pet's life. We can't wait to meet you and your furry family members.\nA Team That Loves Your Pets Like Family\nWhether you're new to the area or looking for a new veterinary home, we're glad you're here. Our experienced team provides attentive care for every stage of your pet's life. We can't wait to meet you and your furry family members.\nDr. Nathan Rolston\nLearn more\nDr. Kathy Shoemaker\nLearn more\nDr. Susie Mackin\nLearn more\nDr. Brad Francis\nLearn more\nStress-Free Pet Care with Online Ordering\nCountryside Veterinary Hospital has an online pharmacy set up with Vetsource to make ordering your pet's medications easy and convenient! Follow the link to create an account, or sign in if you've already got one! Search the medications your pet needs and at check out, set up your billing and shipping address, your pet details, and payment.\nVISIT OUR Online Pharmacy\nDownload the Vello App for Easy Pet Care\nManaging your pet’s health has never been easier. With the Vello app, you can track upcoming appointments and vaccinations, request prescription refills, access medical records, and stay connected with our veterinary team anytime, anywhere.\nHear It Straight From the Pack\nI trust Countryside vet for all of my kittie’s needs. Dr Mackin is an  excellent diagnostician and you can really tell that all the doctors  love critters. The vet techs are very capable and they all love my kitties. The office staff are very kind and capable. I’m so happy that I chose them to care for my babies.\nMary P.\nI called because I thought my cat had gotten into something toxic. They consulted with one of the Dr's. They were friendly, professional and reassuring. I appreciate their dedication to the pet as well as the owner.\nDenise D.\nDr. Shoemaker was so diligent about fitting my dog in with pancreatitis issues even with her full schedule. I very much appreciate their dedication to the pets we all love.\nCathy D.\nThis clinic is warm, friendly and knowledgeable.  Dr Little has and always will see my dogs, he takes time and thoroughly explains everything to us, as well as loves our puppies.\nTara M.\nRead More Reviews\nOne Click Away from Better Pet Health\nContact Us\n3120 S Woodruff Ave, Idaho Falls, ID 83404\n208-522-8010\nOffice Hours\nMonday: 7:30 AM – 6:00 PM\nTuesday: 7:30 AM – 6:00 PM\nWednesday: 7:30 AM – 6:00 PM\nThursday: 7:30 AM – 6:00 PM\nFriday: 7:30 AM – 6:00 PM\nSaturday: Closed\nSunday: Closed\n© 2026 Countryside Veterinary Hospital. All Rights Reserved. |\nPrivacy Policy\n|\nTerms of Use\n|\nAccessibility\n|\nSitemap\nAbout\n← Back\nMeet Our Doctors\n← Back\nDr. Nathan Rolston\nDr. Kathy Shoemaker\nDr. Susie Mackin\nDr. Brad Francis\nJob Opportunities\nCareers\nContact\nReviews\nBlog\nServices\n← Back\nPreventative Care\nWellness Exams\nDental Care\nMicrochipping\nDiagnostics\nSoft Tissue Surgery\nLaser Surgery\nOrthopedic Surgery\nCancer Treatment\nTherapeutic Laser Treatment\nEmergency Care\nBoarding\nResources\n← Back\nCommonly Asked About Conditions\nNew Client Information\n← Back\nNew Client Form\nPayment Plans\nPermission of Care Form\nSurgery Information\nFAQs\nOnline Pharmacy\nPatient Portal\n208-522-8010\n3120 S Woodruff Ave, Idaho Falls, ID 83404",
